SUMMARY:Award-Winning Filipino-American Jazz Vocalist MON DAVID Celebrates 
 
His Birthday
LOCATION:Catalina Jazz Club\, Hollywood
DESCRIPTION:Award-winning Filipino-American jazz vocalist Mon David is cele
 
brated for his remarkable vocal range\, masterful improvisation and deeply 
 
expressive interpretations. Winner of the 2006 London International Vocal J
 
azz Competition\, he brings together jazz sophistication\, heartfelt storyt
 
elling and influences from his Filipino heritage. For this special evening 
 
at Catalina Jazz Club\, Mon joins his children\, Nicole and Carlo\, for an 
 
